tle=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2106ba11326cfe10\" href=\"?note=2106ba11326cfe10\" title=\"58-df-indiscernible.md\">58-df-indiscernible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is a nonempty transitive set and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,\\mathfrak M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\">\\(x,\\mathfrak M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span> are the pure-membership language and its induced set structure (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}\\)</span> are the formula, ordinal, and free-variable constructions</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> are the selected satisfaction-recursion and assignment predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S\\)</span> is the finite assignment-update relation (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"2106ba11326cfe10\" href=\"?note=2106ba11326cfe10\" title=\"58-df-indiscernible.md\">58-df-indiscernible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSetSelected}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSetSelected}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSet}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (selected-data predicate and existential projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set\\text{-}selected} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSetSelected}_S(x,M;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land M\\neq\\varnothing\\land x\\in M\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak M,s_0\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s_0)\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\;\n\\exists\\vec\\alpha\\in\\{\\alpha\\in M:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}^{m}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in m+1\\}\\land\n\\forall y\\in M\\;\\exists\\bar a,t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,m+1,M)\\land\\bar a(0)=y\\land\n\\forall i\\in m\\;(\\bar a(i+1)=\\vec\\alpha(i))\\land\n\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(t,s_0,\\bar a,m+1,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n(y=x\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set\\text{-}selected} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSetSelected}_S(x,M;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land M\\neq\\varnothing\\land x\\in M\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak M,s_0\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\n\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak M,s_0)\\land\n\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\;\n\\exists\\vec\\alpha\\in\\{\\alpha\\in M:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}^{m}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L_{\\in}}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i\\in m+1\\}\\land\n\\forall y\\in M\\;\\exists\\bar a,t\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,m+1,M)\\land\\bar a(0)=y\\land\n\\forall i\\in m\\;(\\bar a(i+1)=\\vec\\alpha(i))\\land\n\\mathrm{FiniteUpdate}_S(t,s_0,\\bar a,m+1,\\mathfrak M)\\land\n(y=x\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,t))\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSet}_S(x,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSetSelected}_S(x,M;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}definable\\text{-}set} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSet}_S(x,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner3OrdinalDefinableSetSelected}_S(x,M;\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is ordinal definability inside the canonical set-coded membership structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>. Absolute OD in the true universe is a metatheoretic class notion and must not quantify <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in V\">\\(y\\in V\\)</span> as though <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> were a set.</li>\n<li>The selected four-place predicate keeps the satisfaction recursion explicit; the public two-place predicate existentially projects it. Finite parameter substitution is realized by the registered finite-update relation rather than an undeclared simultaneous-update notation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"",